#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:584
msgid ""
"Choose which of the WooCommerce Admin features should be disabled. The ones "
"you choose will be <strong>disabled</strong>, and the ones that had not been "
"selected will stay <strong>active</strong>.<br />This list comes from "
"WooCommerce itself. Since WooCommerce 11, WooCommerce only lets plugins "
"switch off a few of its admin features this way (often just Store alerts), "
"so the list may be short. WooCommerce Analytics can be turned off under "
"WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Features, and the Marketing hub with the "
"Marketing Hub option below."
msgstr ""
"Elige qué funciones de la administración de WooCommerce deben desactivarse. "
"Las que elijas se <strong>desactivarán</strong>, y las que no hayas "
"seleccionado seguirán <strong>activas</strong>.<br />Esta lista procede del "
"propio WooCommerce. Desde WooCommerce 11, WooCommerce solo permite a los "
"plugins desactivar de esta forma unas pocas de sus funciones de "
"administración (a menudo solo las alertas de la tienda), así que la lista "
"puede ser corta. Los análisis de WooCommerce se pueden desactivar en "
"WooCommerce > Ajustes > Avanzado > Características, y el centro de marketing "
"con la opción «Centro de marketing» de abajo."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:595
msgid "Disable Marketing"
msgstr "Desactivar marketing"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:596
msgid ""
"This option will completely disable WooCommerce Marketing Hub. Coupon menu "
"entry will stay accessible the old way (WooCommerce -> Coupons)."
msgstr ""
"Esta opción desactivará completamente el centro de marketing de WooCommerce. "
"La entrada de menú de cupones seguirá accesible al modo antiguo (WooCommerce "
"-> Cupones)."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:603
msgid ""
"WooCommerce is constantly trying to promote and advertise add-ons by adding "
"nags to your admin panel. Now you can turn off or hide them."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce intenta constantemente promocionar y anunciar complementos "
"añadiendo recordatorios a tu panel de administración. Ahora puedes "
"desactivarlos u ocultarlos."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:612
msgid "Disable WooCommerce.com notice"
msgstr "Desactivar el aviso de WooCommerce.com"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:613
msgid ""
"Disables notice from WooCommerce.com plugins: <code>Connect your store to "
"WooCommerce.com to receive extensions updates and support</code>."
msgstr ""
"Desactivar el aviso de plugins de WooCommerce.com: <code>Conecta tu tienda "
"con WooCommerce.com para recibir actualizaciones y soporte de las "
"extensiones</code>."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:623
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Marketplace Suggestions"
msgstr "Desactiva las sugerencias del mercado de WooCommerce"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:624
msgid ""
"This option will disable Marketplace Suggestions and promotions. Suggestions "
"are visible on the product edit page and on the Orders pages. It also turns "
"off the \"Show suggestions\" setting in WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > "
"WooCommerce.com, which stops payment, shipping and extension recommendations "
"and remote inbox notes from being fetched."
msgstr ""
"Esta opción desactivará las sugerencias y promociones del mercado. Las "
"sugerencias son visibles en la página de edición de productos y en las "
"páginas de pedidos. También desactiva el ajuste \"Mostrar sugerencias\" en "
"WooCommerce > Ajustes > Avanzado > WooCommerce.com, lo que impide que se "
"obtengan recomendaciones de pago, envío y extensiones, así como notas "
"remotas de la bandeja de entrada."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:634
msgid "Disable Extensions & My Subscriptions submenus"
msgstr "Desactivar los submenús «Extensiones» y «Mis suscripciones»"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:635
msgid ""
"Hide Extensions & My Subscriptions submenus in the WooCommerce menu in your "
"admin panel menu. <strong>Reload the page after saving changes to see the "
"results.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Oculta los submenús de «Extensiones» y «Mis suscripciones» en el menú de "
"WooCommerce de tu menú del panel de administración. <strong>Recarga la "
"página después de guardar los cambios para ver los resultados</strong>."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:645
msgid "Disable Recommended shipping solutions metabox"
msgstr "Desactivar la caja meta de soluciones de envío recomendadas"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:646
msgid ""
"Recommended shipping solutions metabox is appearing on Shipping "
"configurations pages in WooCommerce and is primarily used for advertisement."
msgstr ""
"La caja meta de soluciones de envío recomendadas aparece en las páginas de "
"configuración de envíos de WooCommerce y se usa principalmente para "
"publicidad."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:656
msgid "Disable Recommended payments solutions metabox"
msgstr "Desactivar la caja meta de soluciones de pago recomendadas"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:657
msgid ""
"Recommended payments solutions metabox is appearing on Payments "
"configurations pages in WooCommerce and is primarily used for advertisement."
msgstr ""
"La caja meta de soluciones de pago recomendadas aparece en las páginas de "
"configuración de pagos de WooCommerce y se usa principalmente para "
"publicidad."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:667
msgid ""
"Hide Discover other payment providers link on the Payments Settings screen\n"
msgstr ""
"Ocultar el enlace «Descubre otros proveedores de pago» en la pantalla de "
"ajustes de pagos\n"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:669
msgid ""
"<i>Discover other payment providers</i> link is displayed below your payment "
"gateways and directs the user to the external marketplace with paid "
"extensions."
msgstr ""
"El enlace <i>Descubre otros proveedores de pago</i> se muestra debajo de tus "
"pasarelas de pago y dirige al usuario al mercado externo con extensiones de "
"pago."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:676
msgid ""
"The company behind WooCommerce actively promotes its add-ons, plugins, and "
"extensions. They also affect the emails you receive from your webshop. This "
"behavior can be seen as annoying or nagging by some users. Use the option "
"below to stay balanced."
msgstr ""
"La empresa detrás de WooCommerce promociona activamente sus complementos, "
"plugins y extensiones. Esto también afecta a los correos electrónicos que "
"recibes de tu tienda online. Algunos usuarios pueden ver este comportamiento "
"como molesto o insistente. Usa la opción de abajo para mantener el "
"equilibrio."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:687
msgid "Remove the \"Get the app\" from WooCommerce emails footer"
msgstr ""
"Eliminar «Consigue la aplicación» del pie de los correos electrónicos de "
"WooCommerce"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:689
msgid ""
"WooCommerce is adding its own prompts to the footer of emails sent to the "
"shop's admin. Enable this option to get rid of the annoying text in your "
"emails."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce añade sus propios mensajes al pie de los correos electrónicos "
"enviados al administrador de la tienda. Activa esta opción para eliminar el "
"molesto texto de tus correos electrónicos."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:699
msgid "Disable WooCommerce guide email notifications"
msgstr ""
"Desactivar las notificaciones por correo electrónico de guía de WooCommerce"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:700
msgid ""
"WooCommerce sends email notifications with additional guidance to complete "
"the Store Setup. Enable this option to block this behavior and stop sending "
"these emails."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce envía notificaciones por correo electrónico con orientación "
"adicional para completar la configuración de la tienda. Activa esta opción "
"para bloquear este comportamiento y dejar de enviar estos correos "
"electrónicos."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:707
msgid ""
"Speed up your site by turning off unwanted scripts that are being loaded in "
"the background in admin panel."
msgstr ""
"Acelera tu sitio desactivando los scripts no deseados que se cargan en "
"segundo plano en el panel de administración."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:716
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Status Meta Box"
msgstr "Desactivar la caja meta de estado de WooCommerce"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:717
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will remove WooCommerce Status Meta Box from WordPress "
"Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Al activar esta opción, se eliminará la caja meta del estado de WooCommerce "
"del escritorio de WordPress."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:727
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Dashboard Setup Widget"
msgstr "Desactivar el widget de configuración del escritorio de WooCommerce"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:728
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will remove WooCommerce Dashboard Setup Widget from "
"WordPress Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Al activar esta opción, se eliminará el widget de configuración del "
"escritorio de WooCommerce del escritorio de WordPress."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:740
msgid ""
"This option allows you to disable the new WooCommerce product editor, which "
"is currently in beta and disabled by default (opt-in)."
msgstr ""
"Esta opción te permite desactivar el nuevo editor de productos de "
"WooCommerce, que actualmente está en beta y desactivado por defecto "
"(opcional)."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:751
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Blocks (back-end)"
msgstr "Desactivar los bloques de WooCommerce (administración)"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:753
msgid ""
"Activating this option will disable WooCommerce Blocks scripts from loading "
"in the admin panel. The WordPress Block Editor will load and run faster, but "
"WooCommerce Blocks won't be available to add from the Block Editor level."
msgstr ""
"Al activar esta opción se impedirá que los scripts de los bloques de "
"WooCommerce se carguen en el panel de administración. El editor de bloques "
"de WordPress se cargará y funcionará más rápido, pero los bloques de "
"WooCommerce no estarán disponibles para añadirlos desde el editor de bloques."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:760
msgid ""
"By default, quite a lot of scripts and styles are automatically loading "
"while browsing the front-end of your shop. Use the options below to disable "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, se cargan automáticamente bastantes scripts y estilos al "
"navegar por la parte pública de tu tienda. Usa las opciones de abajo para "
"desactivarlos."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:769
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Widgets"
msgstr "Desactivar widgets de WooCommerce"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:770
msgid ""
"WooCommerce by default comes with a lot of widgets installed. They often are "
"not used at all, but can add backend load and front-end load. Use this "
"option to disable the WooCommerce widgets. <strong>Warning:</strong> Please "
"make sure that you are not using any of WooCommerce Widgets anywhere in your "
"site."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, WooCommerce trae montones de widgets instalados. A menudo no se "
"usan para nada, pero pueden añadir sobrecarga en la administración y en la "
"web. Usa esta opción para desactivar los widgets de WooCommerce. "
"<strong>Advertencia: </strong>Por favor, asegúrate de que no estás usando "
"ningún widget de WooCommerce en algún lugar de tu sitio."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:780
msgid "Disable WooCommerce scripts and styles"
msgstr "Desactivar scripts y estilos de WooCommerce"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:781
msgid ""
"Use this option to disable WooCommerce scripts (javascript) and styles (CSS) "
"everywhere except on product, cart and checkout pages."
msgstr ""
"Utiliza esta opción para desactivar los scripts (Javascript) y estilos (CSS) "
"de WooCommerce en todas partes excepto en las páginas de productos, carrito "
"y finalizar compra."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:791
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Cart Fragments"
msgstr "Desactivar los fragmentos del carrito de WooCommerce"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:792
msgid ""
"The cart fragments feature is used to update the cart total without "
"refreshing the page. <strong>Warning:</strong> Disabling it will speed up "
"your store, but may result in wrong calculations in mini cart. Use with "
"caution."
msgstr ""
"La característica de fragmentos del carrito se utiliza para actualizar el "
"total del carrito sin recargar la página. <strong>Advertencia:</strong> "
"Desactivarlos acelerará tu tienda pero puede resultar en cálculos erróneos "
"en el mini carrito. Úsalo con precaución."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:803
msgid "Disable WooCommerce Blocks (front-end)"
msgstr "Desactivar los bloques de WooCommerce (parte pública)"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:805
msgid ""
"WooCommerce Blocks module loads tons of CSS files (200 KB) in your site "
"front-end. Activating this option will turn off loading the WooCommerce "
"Blocks in your store and should improve page loading speed. If you are using "
"any of the Blocks, they won't display correctly after enabling this option. "
"The Cart and Checkout pages always keep their block styles, so your store "
"can still take orders."
msgstr ""
"El módulo de bloques de WooCommerce carga montones de archivos CSS (200 KB) "
"en la parte pública de tu sitio. Al activar esta opción se dejarán de cargar "
"los bloques de WooCommerce en tu tienda, lo que debería mejorar la velocidad "
"de carga de las páginas. Si usas alguno de los bloques, no se mostrarán "
"correctamente después de activar esta opción. Las páginas de carrito y de "
"finalizar compra siempre mantienen sus estilos de bloques, así que tu tienda "
"puede seguir recibiendo pedidos."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:816
msgid "Disable unnecessary Stripe scripts"
msgstr "Desactivar los scripts innecesarios de Stripe"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-main.php:818
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will disable Stripe Payment Request Button on all "
"product pages. The Stripe scripts won't be loaded on the product pages so "
"the pages should be loading faster."
msgstr ""
"Al activar esta opción se desactivará el botón de solicitud de pago de "
"Stripe en todas las páginas de productos. Los scripts de Stripe no se "
"cargarán en las páginas de productos, por lo que las páginas deberían cargar "
"más rápido."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:22
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings.php:24
msgid "Site performance"
msgstr "Rendimiento del sitio"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:30
msgid "Speed up your site"
msgstr "Acelera tu sitio"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:38
msgid "Password Strength Meter"
msgstr "Meditor de fortaleza de contraseñas"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:52
msgid "Comments scripts"
msgstr "Scripts de comentarios"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:66
msgid "Auto-linking URLs in comments"
msgstr "Enlazado automático de URL en los comentarios"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:80
msgid "Disable Dashicons"
msgstr "Desactivar Dashicons"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:94
msgid "DNS prefetch to s.w.org"
msgstr "Precarga DNS de s.w.org"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:108
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:390
msgid "Disable jQuery Migrate"
msgstr "Desactivar jQuery Migrate"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:122
msgid "Disable Sidebar WordPress Widgets"
msgstr "Desactivar los widgets de la barra lateral de WordPress"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:136
msgid "WordPress & WooCommerce Meta Generator Tag"
msgstr "Etiqueta meta generator de WordPress y WooCommerce"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:150
msgid "Emoji styles and scripts"
msgstr "Estilos y scripts de emojis"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:164
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:565
msgid "Disable wp-embed"
msgstr "Desactivar wp-embed"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:180
msgid "Speculative loading"
msgstr "Carga especulativa"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:181
msgid "Disable speculative loading"
msgstr "Desactivar la carga especulativa"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:182
msgid ""
"Since WordPress 6.8, browsers are told to prefetch pages when a visitor "
"hovers over a link. On a store this can mean extra requests to cart, account "
"and product pages that are never opened, adding server load and noise in "
"your analytics. This option removes the speculation rules script."
msgstr ""
"Desde WordPress 6.8, se indica a los navegadores que precarguen las páginas "
"cuando un visitante pasa el cursor sobre un enlace. En una tienda esto puede "
"suponer peticiones adicionales a páginas de carrito, cuenta y productos que "
"nunca se abren, lo que añade carga al servidor y ruido en tus analíticas. "
"Esta opción elimina el script de reglas de especulación."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:191
msgid "Image auto-sizes CSS"
msgstr "CSS de tamaños automáticos de imágenes"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:192
msgid "Remove the image auto-sizes inline CSS"
msgstr "Eliminar el CSS en línea de tamaños automáticos de imágenes"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:193
msgid ""
"Since WordPress 6.7, every page gets an inline style for lazy-loaded images, "
"and those images get sizes=\"auto\". Disable it if your theme or an image "
"optimization plugin already handles image sizes."
msgstr ""
"Desde WordPress 6.7, cada página recibe un estilo en línea para las imágenes "
"con carga diferida, y esas imágenes reciben sizes=\"auto\". Desactívalo si "
"tu tema o un plugin de optimización de imágenes ya gestiona los tamaños de "
"las imágenes."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:202
msgid "Global styles (classic themes)"
msgstr "Estilos globales (temas clásicos)"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:203
msgid "Remove global styles and classic theme styles"
msgstr "Eliminar los estilos globales y los estilos de temas clásicos"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:204
msgid ""
"Removes the global-styles and classic-theme-styles inline CSS that WordPress "
"adds to every page. Only applies to classic (non-block) themes, block themes "
"are left alone. Do not use it if your content uses block editor colors, font "
"sizes or button styles."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el CSS en línea global-styles y classic-theme-styles que WordPress "
"añade a cada página. Solo se aplica a los temas clásicos (no de bloques); "
"los temas de bloques no se modifican. No lo uses si tu contenido utiliza "
"colores, tamaños de fuente o estilos de botones del editor de bloques."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:211
msgid "Remove scripts from Header"
msgstr "Eliminar scripts de la cabecera"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:219
msgid "RSS Feed Links"
msgstr "Enlaces de feeds RSS"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:233
msgid "RSS feeds"
msgstr "Feeds RSS"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:247
msgid "Feed Generator Tag"
msgstr "Etiqueta generator del feed"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:261
msgid "Windows Live Writer"
msgstr "Windows Live Writer"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:275
#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:289
msgid "RSD Link"
msgstr "Enlace RSD"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:303
msgid "Shortlink"
msgstr "Enlace corto"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:329
msgid ""
"Page load time is very important for your visitors. To improve page load "
"time, try to disable scripts, features, and unnecessary queries:"
msgstr ""
"El tiempo de carga de la página es muy importante para tus visitantes. Para "
"mejorar el tiempo de carga, prueba a desactivar scripts, funciones y "
"consultas innecesarias:"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:335
msgid ""
"Use the settings from this section to reduce page load time on the front-end "
"of your WordPress site. Before disabling them, please make sure that you "
"will not use any of these features - so they can be safely turned off."
msgstr ""
"Usa los ajustes de esta sección para reducir el tiempo de carga de las "
"páginas en la parte pública de tu sitio WordPress. Antes de desactivarlos, "
"asegúrate de que no vas a usar ninguna de estas funciones, para que se "
"puedan desactivar con seguridad."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:345
msgid "Disable Password Strength Meter"
msgstr "Desactivar el medidor de fortaleza de la contraseña"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:346
msgid ""
"Removes the WordPress and WooCommerce password strength meter scripts (over "
"400 KB) from non-essential pages."
msgstr ""
"Elimina los scripts del medidor de fortaleza de las contraseñas de WordPress "
"y WooCommerce (más de 400 KB) de páginas no esenciales."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:356
msgid "Load Comments script only when needed"
msgstr "Cargar el script de comentarios solo cuando sea necesario"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:357
msgid ""
"By default, WordPress Comments javascript files are loaded everywhere on "
"your site. This option will load the Comments script only when needed (on "
"single posts and pages with existing comments)."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, los archivos JavaScript de comentarios de WordPress se cargan "
"en todo tu sitio. Esta opción cargará el script de comentarios solo cuando "
"sea necesario (en entradas individuales y páginas con comentarios "
"existentes)."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:367
msgid "Prevent auto-linking URLs in comments"
msgstr "Evitar el enlazado automático de URL en los comentarios"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:368
msgid ""
"In a standard WordPress installation, adding clickable links to the comments "
"is made on the fly while generating the page which may be time- and resource-"
"consuming. This option will prevent auto-linking URLs in comments."
msgstr ""
"En una instalación estándar de WordPress, los enlaces en los comentarios se "
"convierten en clicables sobre la marcha al generar la página, lo que puede "
"consumir tiempo y recursos. Esta opción evitará el enlazado automático de "
"URL en los comentarios."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:378
msgid "Disable WordPress Dashicons on the front-end"
msgstr "Desactivar los Dashicons de WordPress en la parte pública"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:379
msgid ""
"Dashicons add additional overhead to your site, slowing it down, especially "
"on slower computers or mobile devices. Disabling dashicons can help reduce "
"the total size of your page and improve your site's performance."
msgstr ""
"Los Dashicons añaden una sobrecarga adicional a tu sitio y lo ralentizan, "
"especialmente en ordenadores más lentos o dispositivos móviles. Desactivar "
"los Dashicons puede ayudar a reducir el tamaño total de tu página y mejorar "
"el rendimiento de tu sitio."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:392
msgid ""
"The jQuery Migrate was introduced in WordPress to provide backward "
"compatibility for older jQuery code. However, in recent versions of "
"WordPress, many of the compatibility issues have been resolved, so it is no "
"longer necessary in most cases. Disabling jQuery Migrate can improve the "
"performance of your WordPress website by reducing the amount of JavaScript "
"code that needs to be loaded, and by reducing the number of warnings and "
"error messages that are output to the browser console. Additionally, by "
"disabling the plugin, you can avoid potential security vulnerabilities that "
"may arise from using outdated and unsupported code."
msgstr ""
"jQuery Migrate se introdujo en WordPress para ofrecer compatibilidad con el "
"código jQuery antiguo. Sin embargo, en las versiones recientes de WordPress "
"se han resuelto muchos de los problemas de compatibilidad, por lo que en la "
"mayoría de los casos ya no es necesario. Desactivar jQuery Migrate puede "
"mejorar el rendimiento de tu web WordPress al reducir la cantidad de código "
"JavaScript que hay que cargar y el número de advertencias y mensajes de "
"error que se muestran en la consola del navegador. Además, al desactivar el "
"plugin, puedes evitar posibles vulnerabilidades de seguridad derivadas del "
"uso de código obsoleto y sin soporte."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:403
msgid "Remove DNS prefetch to s.w.org"
msgstr "Eliminar la precarga DNS de s.w.org"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:405
msgid ""
"DNS prefetching is an attempt to resolve domain names before a user tries to "
"follow a link. Activating this option will remove DNS prefetch to s.w.org "
"and may result in page load optimization."
msgstr ""
"La precarga DNS es un intento de resolver los nombres de dominio antes de "
"que un usuario intente seguir un enlace. Al activar esta opción se eliminará "
"la precarga DNS de s.w.org, lo que puede optimizar la carga de la página."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:427
msgid "Archives"
msgstr "Archivos"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:432
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Audio"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:437
msgid "Block"
msgstr "Bloque"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:444
msgid "Calendar"
msgstr "Calendario"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:449
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Categorías"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:454
msgid "Custom HTML"
msgstr "HTML personalizado"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:461
msgid "Gallery"
msgstr "Galería"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:466
msgid "Image"
msgstr "Imagen"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:471
msgid "Meta"
msgstr "Meta"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:478
msgid "Navigation Menu"
msgstr "Menú de navegación"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:483
msgid "Pages"
msgstr "Páginas"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:488
msgid "RSS"
msgstr "RSS"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:495
msgid "Recent Comments"
msgstr "Comentarios recientes"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:500
msgid "Recent Posts"
msgstr "Entradas recientes"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:505
msgid "Search"
msgstr "Buscar"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:512
msgid "Tag Cloud"
msgstr "Nube de etiquetas"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:517
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Texto"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:522
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Vídeo"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:527
msgid ""
"WordPress by default comes with a lot of sidebar widgets installed. They "
"often are not used at all, but can add backend load and front-end load. "
"Choose which sidebar widgets you would like to disable for this site. The "
"<strong>ones you choose will be disabled</strong>, and the <strong>ones that "
"had not been selected will stay active</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, WordPress trae muchos widgets de barra lateral instalados. A "
"menudo no se usan para nada, pero pueden añadir carga en la administración y "
"en la web. Elige los widgets de barra lateral que quieras desactivar en este "
"sitio. Los <strong>que elijas se desactivarán</strong>, y los <strong>que no "
"hayas seleccionado seguirán activos</strong>."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:539
msgid "Remove WordPress & WooCommerce Meta Generator Tag"
msgstr "Eliminar la etiqueta meta generator de WordPress y WooCommerce"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:541
msgid ""
"Meta Generator Tag displays the WordPress & WooCommerce version number. "
"Removing the meta generator tag protects you against attacks and may reduce "
"your web page's size. Use this option to disable the Meta Tag generated by "
"WordPress, WooCommerce, and many other plugins that hook up with the "
"wp_generator action."
msgstr ""
"La etiqueta meta generator muestra el número de versión de WordPress y "
"WooCommerce. Eliminarla te protege frente a ataques y puede reducir el "
"tamaño de tu página web. Usa esta opción para desactivar la etiqueta meta "
"generada por WordPress, WooCommerce y muchos otros plugins que se enganchan "
"a la acción wp_generator."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:552
msgid "Remove emoji styles and scripts"
msgstr "Eliminar los estilos y scripts de emojis"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:554
msgid ""
"Remove the code bloat used to add support for emojis in older browsers. "
"Emoticons and emojis will still work in browsers that have built-in support "
"for them."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el código innecesario usado para añadir compatibilidad con emojis en "
"navegadores antiguos. Los emoticonos y emojis seguirán funcionando en los "
"navegadores que los admiten de forma nativa."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:567
msgid ""
"Prevents the WordPress core feature known as wp-embed from loading on your "
"website. The wp-embed feature allows you to embed videos, images, tweets, "
"and other types of content from various platforms by pasting a URL into the "
"WordPress editor. While this feature can be useful, it can also slow down "
"your site's loading times, increase your server resources usage, and pose "
"potential security risks."
msgstr ""
"Impide que la función del núcleo de WordPress conocida como wp-embed se "
"cargue en tu web. La función wp-embed te permite incrustar vídeos, imágenes, "
"tuits y otros tipos de contenido de distintas plataformas pegando una URL en "
"el editor de WordPress. Aunque esta función puede ser útil, también puede "
"ralentizar los tiempos de carga de tu sitio, aumentar el uso de recursos de "
"tu servidor y suponer posibles riesgos de seguridad."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:574
msgid ""
"Remove unwanted scripts from the Header section of your site. The header "
"section is used on all of your subpages and in most cases you do not need to "
"load all the default scripts. Use the option below to turn them off."
msgstr ""
"Elimina los scripts no deseados de la sección de cabecera de tu sitio. La "
"sección de cabecera se usa en todas tus subpáginas y, en la mayoría de los "
"casos, no necesitas cargar todos los scripts por defecto. Usa la opción de "
"abajo para desactivarlos."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:584
msgid "Remove RSS Feed Links"
msgstr "Eliminar los enlaces de feeds RSS"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:586
msgid ""
"If you do not use RSS feeds, you can safely turn them off without losing any "
"functionality. Links to RSS Feeds will be removed from the site header, but "
"the process of generating RSS feeds will still be active."
msgstr ""
"Si no usas feeds RSS, puedes desactivarlos con seguridad sin perder ninguna "
"funcionalidad. Los enlaces a los feeds RSS se eliminarán de la cabecera, "
"pero el proceso de generación de feeds RSS seguirá activo."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:597
msgid "Disable all RSS feeds"
msgstr "Desactivar todos los feeds RSS"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:599
msgid ""
"You can also completely disable the RSS generation process by activating "
"this option. If it is a feature that you do not plan to use, you can disable "
"RSS Feeds."
msgstr ""
"También puedes desactivar por completo el proceso de generación de RSS "
"activando esta opción. Si es una función que no piensas usar, puedes "
"desactivar los feeds RSS."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:610
msgid "Remove the Generator Tag From RSS Feeds"
msgstr "Eliminar la etiqueta generator de los feeds RSS"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:612
msgid "This option will Remove the Generator Tag From RSS Feeds"
msgstr "Esta opción eliminará la etiqueta generator de los feeds RSS"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:623
msgid "Remove Link to the Windows Live Writer Manifest File"
msgstr "Eliminar el enlace al archivo de manifiesto de Windows Live Writer"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:625
msgid ""
"If are not using software called Windows Live Writer, you can safely turn "
"off this feature that is added to your header by default."
msgstr ""
"Si no usas el software llamado Windows Live Writer, puedes desactivar con "
"seguridad esta función que se añade a tu cabecera por defecto."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:636
msgid "Remove RSD link"
msgstr "Eliminar el enlace RSD"

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:638
msgid ""
"RSD link is a tag that is added to your Header by default. The RSD link is "
"used by software blog clients. If you access your site admin panel from the "
"browser then it is safe for you to remove the RSD Link."
msgstr ""
"El enlace RSD es una etiqueta que se añade a tu cabecera por defecto. Lo "
"usan los clientes de software para blogs. Si accedes al panel de "
"administración de tu sitio desde el navegador, puedes eliminar el enlace RSD "
"con seguridad."

#: includes/settings/class-disable-bloat-settings-performance.php:649
